# local data (raw archives, bulk files) — not committed, with one exception:
# the Scryfall oracle-cards bulk snapshot is committed (gzipped, ~23MB) because
# this environment's network policy blocks api.scryfall.com/data.scryfall.io,
# so rebuilds must be reproducible from the repo alone (owner decision,
# 2026-07-07; provenance in docs/notes/scryfall-oracle-cards-observed-schema.md)
data/*
!data/scryfall/
data/scryfall/*
!data/scryfall/oracle-cards.jsonl.gz

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
build/
dist/
.venv/
